      "summary_sent_score": 0.3265754282474518
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "The O.P. No. 2 lodged an FIR on 22.9.2009 registered as Crime No. 422 of 2009, under section 498A, 323, 504 IPC and 3/4 D.P. Act with the allegations that marriage of her sister Babli was solemnized with Manoj Kumar Sindhi.",
